{"id":"en_my-zombie-road-trip-through-the-apocalypse","title":"My Zombie Road Trip Through the Apocalypse","titleEn":"My Zombie Road Trip Through the Apocalypse","description":"Ella, a lonely and despondent young woman, chooses to be bitten during a zombie outbreak, but the infection leaves her mind human even as her body turns undead. No longer troubled by hunger or pain, she wanders across America and quietly rescues survivors. Along the way she meets Ethan, an evolved zombie of considerable strength, and together they stay ahead of soldiers and superhumans while searching for liberty and a strange romance between the living dead.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-zombie-road-trip-through-the-apocalypse/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-zombie-road-trip-through-the-apocalypse/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Apocalyptic","Fantasy","Sweet Romance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7df0ka/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-zombie-road-trip-through-the-apocalypse_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7df0ka/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-zombie-road-trip-through-the-apocalypse_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7df0ka/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-zombie-road-trip-through-the-apocalypse_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7df0ka/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-zombie-road-trip-through-the-apocalypse_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources"